    given-names: Hugh
version: "2026.10.26-full-audit-2"
date-released: "2026-10-26"
url: "https://lamarque-mapping.github.io/Border-Closure-Atlas/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/lamarque-mapping/Border-Closure-Atlas"
abstract: >-
  A research register of reported international land-border restrictions and
  cross-border river-ferry restrictions within 21 October 2016 to 21 October 2026.
  This edition contains 829 records and 1,069 phases following two additional
  full-register source audits. Coverage is incomplete;
  uncertainty, source-access limits and unresolved findings remain explicit.
